## How to Draw Them (Adafruit_GFX / TFT_eSPI Example)
To render these efficiently on your screen without flickering, use your library's standard bitmap function. You can explicitly assign any color combination you want:

// Arguments: drawBitmap(x_pos, y_pos, bitmap_array, width, height, foreground_color, background_color);// Example: Drawing a green Wi-Fi icon at the top right of the screen (x=300, y=5)

tft.drawBitmap(300, 5, bitmap_wifi_16x16, 16, 16, TFT_GREEN, TFT_BLACK);





